class csmp::FiniteElementManager1< dim, INTPOL_ORDER, USING_LOCAL_COORDS >"Alternative version of \fBFiniteElementManager\fP where all elements are stored on the stack (initialised at compile time in the body of the class) 


.PP
\fBAttention\fP
.RS 4
IS SLOWER THAN MANAGER WHERE ELEMENTS ARE CREATED ON THE HEAP!!!! - and less flexible! (SKM30/6/2024)
.RE
.PP
@atttention needs specialisations for
.IP "\(bu" 2
1, 2, and 3D
