with and without local coordinate system
.IP "\(bu" 2
with linear and with quadratic interpolation function
.PP

.PP
\fBNote\fP
.RS 4
USING_LOCAL_COORDS refers to whether the element is defined in parametric space coordinates (r,s,t) like all the isoparametric elements in CSMP
.RE
